sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Гость
    participant GW as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant CS as Catalog Service
    participant CACHE as Valkey Cache
    participant DB as booking_db
    participant K as Kafka
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant RS as Review Service

    U->>GW: POST /api/bookings {room_id, dates, user_id}
    GW->>BS: маршрутизация запроса (rate-limit пройден)
    BS->>CACHE: SET NX PX lock:booking:{room_id}:{dates}
    alt блокировка занята другим гостем
        BS-->>U: 409 Conflict
    end
    BS->>CS: GET /rooms/{room_id}/availability?dates=...
    CS->>CACHE: проверить кэш доступности
    alt кэш пуст
        CS->>CS: запрос к catalog_db
        CS->>CACHE: обновить кэш (TTL)
    end
    CS-->>BS: 200 OK { available: true }
    BS->>DB: SELECT пересекающиеся активные брони (2-я линия защиты)
    BS->>DB: INSERT booking (status=PENDING)
    BS->>K: publish booking.created {booking_id, amount}
    BS->>CACHE: DEL lock (снятие блокировки)
    BS-->>U: 202 Accepted { booking_id, status: PENDING }

    K-->>PS: consume booking.created
    PS->>PS: обработать платёж (mock acquiring)
    alt платёж успешен
        PS->>K: publish payment.completed {booking_id}
    else платёж отклонён
        PS->>K: publish payment.failed {booking_id, reason}
    end

    K-->>BS: consume payment.completed / payment.failed
    alt успех
        BS->>DB: UPDATE booking SET status=CONFIRMED
        BS->>K: publish booking.confirmed {booking_id, user_id}
    else отказ
        BS->>DB: UPDATE booking SET status=CANCELLED
        BS->>K: publish booking.cancelled {booking_id, reason}
    end

    K-->>CS: consume booking.confirmed / booking.cancelled
    CS->>CS: обновить blocked_date_ranges (read-модель)
    CS->>CACHE: инвалидировать ключи availability:{room_id}:*

    K-->>RS: consume booking.confirmed
    RS->>RS: выдать право на отзыв (review_eligibility)

    K-->>NS: consume booking.confirmed / booking.cancelled
    NS->>NS: сформировать письмо/SMS
    NS->>NS: записать в notification_log (MongoDB)
    NS--)U: Email/SMS о статусе брони
